	"data": "Storage Evaluation & Disorder Map\n\nAudited: Sept 22, 2026\nPurpose: Identify what lives where, find duplicated/scattered data, plan a drive organization pass.\n\nDrive Overview\n\n| Drive | Size | Used | Free | FS | Mount | Role (current) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| sda (1TB SSD) | 932G | 827G (90%) | 100G | btrfs | /home | Active OS + dev + workspace |\n| sdb (700G HDD) | 699G | 637G (92%) | 62G | NTFS | /run/media/.../Storage | Legacy Windows data dump |\n| sdc (954G SSD) | 953G | — | — | NTFS…",
